;TEMPLATE

@CUSTOM_FETISH_NAME_GENERAL_0(CF_STRING="name")
#FUNCTIONS
#DIMS CF_STRING
[IF_DEBUG]
SELECTCASE CF_STRING
CASE "name"
    CFM_RETURN '= @"State compliance mode"
CASE "enabled"
    CFM_RETURN '= @"%StateComplienceMode()%"
CASE "header"
    CFM_RETURN '= @""
CASE "description"
    CFM_RETURN '= @"Not something for NASGen, but for /EGG/ that would delete a game with 5 fetishes."
ENDSELECT
[ENDIF]

@CUSTOM_FETISH_RESULT_GENERAL_0
[IF_NDEBUG]
RETURN
[ENDIF]

PRINTFORML Enabling State Compliance mode will permanently disable certain features you turn it off.
PRINTFORML [0] - Disabled
PRINTFORML Disabled: None
PRINTL
PRINTFORML [1] - /EGG/ Approved 
PRINTFORML Disabled: Gore, Necrophilia, Scat, Diapers
PRINTL
PRINTFORML [2] - Lax
